sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Page (PlanRunner)
    participant W as chunkWorker.js (one chunk)
    participant S as ChunkLoader / IndexedDB
    P->>W: new Worker(chunkWorker.js)
    P->>W: {type:'init', ortUrl, wasmPaths, numThreads}
    W-->>P: {ok, heapBytes}
    P->>W: {type:'load', entry, cache, exitEntry?}
    W->>S: getBytes(entry): IndexedDB → verify SHA-256 → else network
    S-->>W: bytes (source: idb | network)
    W-->>P: {ok, stats, heapBytes}
    loop each sentence in the group
        P->>W: {type:'run', feeds, withExit} — feeds' buffers TRANSFERRED
        W-->>P: {ok, outputs, runMs, heapBytes} — output buffers TRANSFERRED back
    end
    alt chunk not pinned
        P->>W: worker.terminate() — Worker and its WASM heap destroyed (D-3, measured in the cloud)
    else pinned (resident / hybrid)
        Note over P,W: Worker stays alive for the next request
    end
